00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Speaker 1: Assalomu alaykum, aziz birodarlar.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,500
Bugun biz Abu Bakr Siddiq roziyallohu anhuning
siyratlarini o‘rganishni davom ettiramiz.

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:13,000
Bismillah. قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم: لو كنت متخذا خليلا لاتخذت أبا بكر خليلا deb aytdilar.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Bu hadisdan biz biz Abu Bakrning,, martabasini bilib olamiz.

5
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:26,000
Alloh taolo aytadi: ثاني اثنين إذ هما في الغار  ya'ni g`orda ikkalasi edi.
